          <p>
            You are solely responsible for Your Content and for ensuring you
            have the rights to use, process, and share it.
          </p>

          <h2>6. AI and third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            AnySpace integrates with AI providers, speech-to-text providers,
            payment processors, and other third-party services. Some you
            configure yourself (e.g., your own OpenAI or Anthropic API key);
            some are offered through AnySpace Cloud as an optional convenience.
