              the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, are the entire
              agreement between you and AnySpace regarding the Service.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Severability.</strong> If any provision is held
              unenforceable, the remainder will remain in effect.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Waiver.</strong> Our failure to enforce a provision is
              not a waiver of our right to enforce it later.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Assignment.</strong> You may not assign these Terms
